1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,763
Imagine being dumb enough to give yourself unlimited credit, with your customers' money.

2
00:00:05,063 --> 00:00:05,976
This guy did.

3
00:00:06,376 --> 00:00:10,333
Sam Bankman-Fried ran FTX. Over a million users.

4
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:14,543
His other firm, Alameda, could borrow with no limit. No collateral.

5
00:00:14,843 --> 00:00:18,800
His own engineer testified a few simple code tweaks made it happen.

6
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:23,833
Alameda took about eight billion dollars. Then everyone tried to withdraw. Empty.

7
00:00:24,183 --> 00:00:26,922
Seven counts. Guilty. Twenty-five years.

8
00:00:27,322 --> 00:00:32,753
Real question. Genius, or just a thief who got lucky for a while? Tell me in the comments.

9
00:00:33,053 --> 00:00:34,823
Follow. The next con is worse.
